# 7. Day 1 Coding Practice

## Employee Example

```java
class Employee {

    int id;
    String name;
    double salary;

    void display() {

        System.out.println(id);
        System.out.println(name);
        System.out.println(salary);
    }
}

public class Test {

    public static void main(String[] args) {

        Employee e1 = new Employee();

        e1.id = 101;
        e1.name = "Rahul";
        e1.salary = 45000;

        e1.display();
    }
}
```

### Expected Output

```text
101
Rahul
45000.0
```

